{
  "info": {
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "P04 is in progress. Only implemented requests are present. Select a journey, never run all decisions blindly. Use an isolated review database and confirmed test Merchant/Admin accounts from P02 setup. Shared real cookie jar, HTTPS with certificate validation, fresh principal-bound CSRF. Capture the merchant id/version using Own review before switching to Admin; decisions return the next version. Reasons are mandatory except approve. Personal trial is Deferred. Later P04 steps extend this collection. S03 store requests require a confirmed Merchant, one active Catalog activity and at least one contact. Upload a file manually; store activity cannot be changed by details edits. Public requests are expected200 only after approval and when the optional logo exists. These instructions do not claim a personal trial.",
    "name": "HawalekNow P04 merchants and stores"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const method = pm.request.method.toUpperCase();",
          "if (!['GET','HEAD','OPTIONS','TRACE'].includes(method)) {",
          "  const base = pm.environment.get('baseUrl');",
          "  if (!/^https:\\/\\/(localhost|127\\.0\\.0\\.1)(:\\d+)?$/.test(base || '')) throw new Error('Configure a trusted local HTTPS baseUrl.');",
          "  pm.sendRequest({ url: base + '/api/v1/identity/csrf', method: 'GET' }, (error, response) => {",
          "    if (error || response.code !== 200) throw new Error('CSRF bootstrap failed.');",
          "    const csrf = response.json();",
          "    pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: csrf.headerName, value: csrf.requestToken });",
          "  });",
          "}"
        ]
      },
      "listen": "prerequest"
    }
  ],
